WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:03.960
Defend why defend?

00:05.160 --> 00:09.040
I have let the people rest and prepared for war for decades.

00:10.160 --> 00:13.600
Reformed ancestral institutions all along.

00:14.520 --> 00:20.160
Countless people have been sacrificed all of this was never for the word "defend"

00:22.920 --> 00:24.320
The situation has changed.

00:25.560 --> 00:26.960
I will do.

00:28.000 --> 00:29.400
What Wuzhao cannot imagine.

00:30.560 --> 00:31.960
And dare not think.

00:33.080 --> 00:36.707
I will personally lead the central army.

00:38.040 --> 00:43.320
To face Shilang Your Majesty must not Your Majesty, Your Majesty how can Your Majesty go to such a dangerous place?

00:43.400 --> 00:47.000
Your servant concurs if the battle situation changes.

00:47.280 --> 00:50.280
How should we respond?

00:51.080 --> 00:55.800
Your Majesty, please reconsider enough.

00:57.920 --> 01:01.547
The people of the north they have waited long enough.

01:02.320 --> 01:06.720
This is not about wanting to do it or being able to do it.

01:06.800 --> 01:10.080
But that the divine land must be unified.

